      "location": "5.1",
      "defect": "unlicensed-inference",
      "evidence": "Step 5.1 states, “Minimality gives a_{n_m-1}<m^2.” If A_0=Ω, then n_1=0, whereas a_n was defined only for n∈N, so a_{n_1-1}=a_{-1} is undefined. A separate m=1 case supplies the needed bound, but the displayed inference does not cover that endpoint as written.",
